<section id="S7" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">7 </span>Implementation Details</h2>

<figure id="S7.F8" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2602.21591v1/network_structure2.svg" id="S7.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:685/151;" width="685" height="151"></object></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2602.21591v1/network_structure4.svg" id="S7.F8.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:685/237;" width="685" height="237"></object></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S7.F8.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 8</span>: </span><span id="S7.F8.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Network structures of the main modules, including the main analysis transform <math id="S7.F8.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g_{a}</annotation></semantics></math>, main synthesis transform <math id="S7.F8.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g_{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g_{s}</annotation></semantics></math>, hyper analysis transform <math id="S7.F8.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{a}</annotation></semantics></math>, hyper synthesis transform <math id="S7.F8.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h_{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{s}</annotation></semantics></math>, auxiliary decoder <math id="S7.F8.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g_{aux}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g_{aux}</annotation></semantics></math>, uncertainty estimation network <math id="S7.F8.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{u}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{u}</annotation></semantics></math>, and the context model. For efficient network construction, we primarily rely on modified versions of InceptionNeXt <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib12" title="" class="ltx_ref">62</a>]</cite>, GatedCNN <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib11" title="" class="ltx_ref">61</a>]</cite>, and their combination (StarBlock).</span></figcaption>
</figure>
