<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S7.F9.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 9</span>: </span><span id="S7.F9.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Illustration of our entropy modeling process.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
